DESCRIPTION:Bob Dodd invites you to join him on September 20 for a hike at 
 the IU Research and Teaching Preserve on the south side of Griffey Lake. Th
 ere are five trails here\, each no more than a mile in length. We will plan
  to hike at least a mile and can do more depending on the desire of the par
 ticipants. We should be seeing a little fall color by this time and may hav
 e some brisk early fall temperatures. We will meet in the church parking lo
 t in time to leave at 9:30. Please let Bob Dodd know if you plan to join us
 .
