DESCRIPTION:Area 10 Food Drive: On Sunday September 21st\, we will conduct 
 a food drive to benefit Area 10. Please bring your food with you on that Su
 nday and put it by the MCUM food box in the hallway. As I am sure you are a
 ll aware\, all of the local agencies involved with providing food to the ne
 edy are struggling to have enough food. Your generous contributions are ver
 y much appreciated by the Outreach committee and Area 10.\nArea 10 is parti
 cularly in need of canned meats (tuna\, chicken\, salmon\, etc)\, canned fr
 uits and boxed food items (such as pasta and hamburger helper)\, peanut but
 ter and jelly\, cans of vegetables\, cans of soup and canned beans. Please 
 make sure that none of the food is past its expiration date. They canât u
 se expired foods. \nOf course\, all gifts of cash are also appreciated. If 
 you give cash\, please write in the memo line on your check âArea 10 Food
  Drive.â\nThis food will be used to serve the Area 10 clients helped by o
 ur mission project.\nThank you. \nThe Outreach Committee
LAST-MODIFIED:20151027T131701Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Fall Food Drive for Area 10 Agency on Aging
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
