UID:umijgej398bd984ftr1g4klgbc@google.com
CREATED:20151027T131257Z
DESCRIPTION:We will be hiking the five-mile sycamore loop\, a trail in the 
 only federal wilderness area in Indiana. The hike is of easy to moderate di
 fficulty. We will walk fairly slowly so we can enjoy the early fall scenery
  on this heavily wooded route. We will meet at 8:00 a.m. at the church park
 ing lot and car pool to the site south of Lake Monroe. Please let the Dodds
  know if you plan to join us. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20151027T131701Z
LOCATION:Meet at Church Parking lot to drive to Deam Wilderness
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Presbyterians Outdoors!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
