CREATED:20151027T132451Z
DESCRIPTION:Adult Classes:\nFaith Forum meets in Room 7 downstairs.\nNo-Pre
 p Bible Study meets in Parlor upstairs. \nEveryday Spirituality meets in Ro
 om 5 downstairs. \nFellowship Time/Coffee Hour is in Lyman Hall. \n\nChildr
 en & Youth: \nPreschoolers (3-5 year olds) meet in the preschool room on th
 e Ground Floor of Walker Hall.\nKindergarten-2nd Grade will meet in room W2
 09 (the blue room) on the second floor of Walker Hall. \n3rd-5th Grade will
  meet in room W210 (the red room) on the second floor of Walker Hall. \nDis
 ciples (6th-8th Grade) meet in the “Upper Room."\n9th- 12th Grade will meet
  in Lyman Hall at 10:00 to grab coffee and a treat before heading downstair
 s to the youth room. \nConfirmation is meeting in room 27. 
